"存在n 阶矩阵C，使得A = CTC B. 二次型X TAX 的负惯性指数为0","C":"存在可逆矩阵P, 使得P-1AP = E D. A 的伴随矩阵A*与E 合同1 2 0"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-mcq-5.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-mcq-5.jpg","answer":"D","facets":["pd","congruent"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-mcq-6","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":6,"pdf_page":166,"stem":"设A = 2 0 2 , 若存在可逆矩阵C, 使得CTAC = Λ, 则C 可能为( ).\n0 2 -1\n1 -1 -1 1 1 1\n1 2 0 1 2 0\n1 1 1 1","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"base","options":{"A":"0","B":"0 2 -1","C":"0 1 2"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-mcq-6.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-mcq-6.jpg","answer":"A","facets":["congruent"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-mcq-7","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":7,"pdf_page":167,"stem":"设A = 1 1 0 ，则下列矩阵中与A 既不相似也不合同的是( ).\n0 0 1\n3 0 0 1 2 1 1 -1 0 1 0 0","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"base","options":{"A":"0 2 0","B":"2 5 2","C":"-1 1 0"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-mcq-7.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-mcq-7.jpg","answer":"D","facets":["congruent","inertia"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-mcq-8","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":8,"pdf_page":167,"stem":"设A 是实对称矩阵，B = bij 3×3 是可逆矩阵，且AB = b21 2b22 -b23 ，则二次型X TAX 的\nb31 2b32 -b33\n规范形为( ).","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"base","options":{"A":"y2 1 + y2 2 + y2","B":"y2 1 + y2 2 - y2","C":"y2 1 - y2 2 - y2"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-mcq-8.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-mcq-8.jpg","answer":"B","facets":["inertia"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-mcq-9","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":9,"pdf_page":167,"stem":"设二次型f x1,x2,x3 = x2 1 + x2 2 + x2 3 - 4x1x2 - 4x1x3 - 4x2x3, 则f x1,x2,x3 = 1 在空间直角坐标系\n下表示的二次曲面为( ).","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"base","options":{"A":"椭球面","B":"柱面","C":"单叶双曲面","D":"双叶双曲面"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-mcq-9.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-mcq-9.jpg","answer":"C","facets":["inertia","quadric"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-mcq-10","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":10,"pdf_page":168,"stem":"若二次曲面x2 + k+2 y2 + kz2 + 2xy = 5 表示一个椭球面，则(\n)","kp_ids":["la.eig.pd"],"part":"base","options":{"A":"k > 0","B":"k < 0","C":"k >-1","D":"k <-1"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-mcq-10.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-mcq-10.jpg","answer":"A","facets":["pd","quadric"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-fill-1","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"fill","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":1,"pdf_page":168,"stem":"已知二次型f x1,x2,x3 = x2 1 + 4x2 2 + 4x2 3 + 2ax1x2 - 2x1x3 + 4x2x3 正定, 则a 的取值范围为____\n_.","kp_ids":["la.eig.pd"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-fill-1.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-fill-1.jpg","facets":["pd","quad_matrix"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-fill-2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"fill","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":2,"pdf_page":168,"stem":"设二次型f x1,x2,x3 = X TAX AT=A 在正交变换下的标准形为-2y2 1 + 8y2 2，且E + B = AB，其\n中B 为3 阶矩阵，则迹tr B-1+2E = _____.","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-fill-2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-fill-2.jpg","facets":["ortho_trans"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-big-1","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":1,"pdf_page":169,"stem":"设二次型f x1,x2,x3 = 2x2 1 + 5x2 2 + 5x2 3 + 4x1x2 - 4x1x3 - 8x2x3.\n(I) 求一个正交变换x = Qy, 将f 化为标准形;\n(II) 利用配方法, 将f 化为标准形.","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-big-1.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-big-1.jpg","facets":["ortho_trans","complete_square"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-big-2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":2,"pdf_page":169,"stem":"已知二次型f = 2x2 1 + 3x2 2 + 3x2 3 + 2ax2x3 a>0 ，经过正交变换化成标准形y2 1 + 2y2 2 + 5y2 3，求参\n数a 及所用的正交变换.\n2 0 1 0 0 0","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-big-2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-big-2.jpg","facets":["ortho_trans"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-big-3","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":3,"pdf_page":170,"stem":"设A = 0 2 -1 与B = 0 b 0 合同.\n1 -1 a-1 0 0 3\n(I) 求a 的值及b 的取值范围;\n(II) 若存在正交矩阵Q, 使得QTAQ = B, 求b 及Q.\n2 + x2-x3 2 + x1+ax3 2.","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-big-3.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-big-3.jpg","facets":["congruent","inertia","ortho_trans"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-big-4","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":4,"pdf_page":171,"stem":"设二次型f x1,x2,x3 = x1+x2\n(I) 求f x1,x2,x3 = 0 的解;\n(II) 当f x1,x2,x3 = 0 有非零解时, 求正交变换X = QY 将f x1,x2,x3 化为标准形;\n(III) 求f x1,x2,x3 的规范形.","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-big-4.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-big-4.jpg","facets":["complete_square","ortho_trans","inertia"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-big-5","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":5,"pdf_page":172,"stem":"设3 阶实对称矩阵A = α1,α2,α3 有二重特征值1, 且α1 + 2α2 - α3 = 0,A*是A 的伴随矩阵.\n(I) 求正交变换X = QY 将二次型f x1,x2,x3 = X TAX 化为标准形;\n(II) 求方程组A*X = 0 的通解.\n3","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-big-5.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-big-5.jpg","facets":["ortho_trans"]},{"id":"ll-base-15-big-6","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"15","section_name":"二次型","qno":6,"pdf_page":173,"stem":"设实对称矩阵A = aij 3×3 有二重特征值1, 且 aij = 0 j=1,2,3 .\ni=1\n(I) 记X = x1,x2,x3 T, 求方程X TAX = 0 的全部解;\n(II) 求可逆矩阵P, 使得X T 2E-A X = ||PX||2.","kp_ids":["la.eig.quad","la.eig.pd"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-15-big-6.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-15-big-6.jpg","facets":["inertia","pd_complete"]}]